    <title>On the Theoretical Foundation of Overset Grid Methods for Hyperbolic Problems II: Entropy Bounded Formulations for Nonlinear Conservation Laws</title>
    <updated>2022-09-12T18:31:20Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.11149v2" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
